 sets so constructed\nsatisfies the property that the map on stalks\n<MATH_0025>\nis the colimit of the system of maps <MATH_0026> as\n<MATH_0027> varies over those elements that\ncontain <MATH_0028> and <MATH_0029> varies over those elements that\ncontain <MATH_0030>. In particular, if <MATH_0031> and <MATH_0032>\nare the underlying sheaves of sets of sheaves of algebraic structures,\nthen we see that the maps on stalks is a morphism of algebraic\nstructures. Hence we conclude that the associated map of\nsheaves of underlying sets <MATH_0033>\nsatisfies the assumptions of\nLemma <REF_0004>.\nWe conclude that <MATH_0034>\nis a morphism of sheaves with values in <MATH_0035>.\nAnd by adjointness this means that <MATH_0036> is\nan <MATH_0037>-map of sheaves of algebraic structures.\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3a67e7b52b896ffb6065a149585d2142fed8421a6fd83bb0c2e5fd7d2a787522", "unit_id": "inventory:sheaves:009X:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:8c65b5405adf8504a8c965580190707b2a1c90c6f416e24a218a02742b0f46da", "hash": "sha256:8c65b5405adf8504a8c965580190707b2a1c90c6f416e24a218a02742b0f46da", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 155240, "byte_start": 155181, "file": "sheaves.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:9c51c0ce77d15a0656628d98e695ccae537b774e383e4ca5728674ecd95dd70d", "line_end": 4437, "line_start": 4435}, "owner_tag": "009Y", "parent_tag": "009H", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "009H", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5b12a4d29fe42a7c344085b36852ec7b068eec040a576104d5b364